8f4e/v1

note
; @config testRuntime.enabled true

Group modules run before their parent's modules, even when
the parent module appears first in the source.
noteEnd

entry test
module root
int* input &audio:output

push *input
assertEqual 1
moduleEnd

group audio
expose output &grouped:value

module grouped
int value
push &value
push 1
store
moduleEnd
groupEnd
entryEnd
